  (text "Section 8 of the circuit notes and the design notes. Blend is MidHump's addition: a full-range clean copy of the\ninput, added at Blend x 0.5 (cleanTrim, chosen). UX3 sums it with the driven path, both inverted, with +11.8 dB\nof make-up for the DSP's Level range of -40 to +12 dB (chosen). RVX4: the pedal's 100 kOhm audio volume pot [2].\nUX4 inverts back to the input's polarity (chosen). RVX3 is small against RX7 so the Blend law stays linear." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4923d030-283e-5376-abf1-e357bc800490"))
